{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "policy": "Review-only pins. Offline checks all selected local bytes and every repeated copy. Online additionally verifies immutable upstream artifacts and compares latest npm releases / current GitHub default-branch files. Drift fails; nothing auto-updates. Whole upstream file/archive hashes intentionally require review for non-identity changes too.",
  "excluded": [
    "Lemon-owned identities: OpenCode Go user-agent lemon_ai; Codex OAuth originator lemon; Z.AI API key name lemon.",
    "Google Gemini CLI and Antigravity OAuth client IDs/secrets are supplied by operators, not bundled vendor IDs. No secret values belong in this manifest.",
    "Explicit caller header/client-id overrides, tokens, account/session/device IDs and actual host/OS values are runtime inputs, not upstream pins.",
    "Generic protocol versions and capability betas (outside the Claude OAuth fingerprint) are API contracts, not imitated clients. Tool dialect selection/plumbing is maintained separately."
  ],
